package token

// This fixture controls issuer facts,
// catalog/routing/tariff and the external provider, not either money repository.
// Historical timestamps are generated by the original injectable Token clock;
// eligibility still uses PostgreSQL transaction_timestamp(). No real 24-hour
// waiting, production issuer, deployment, or externally billed usage is claimed.
